                <syl /><neume facs="#m-9588afdf-a48d-44c9-8d46-7c48cee76244" type="punctum" xml:id="m-b7dc11f2-286a-4c04-972c-15667c15bf42">
                  <nc xml:id="m-f4ee088d-cbc9-4bda-91fe-a21df124c6ac" pname="e" oct="3" tilt="se" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-beff6737-0e03-44ff-aaba-e74aa59ed7b8">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-46bedfa4-028a-4e4e-9156-7159bbda1b11" type="punctum" xml:id="m-5532d61b-17dc-412b-9244-a7eddbc4e5fd">
                  <nc xml:id="m-571a4e07-cae8-425c-a62e-5d5d6265af0d" pname="d" oct="3" tilt="se" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-fee928e3-5c94-41cb-8620-0cd3c9496d38">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-2b6242e2-2e1d-443a-802f-078c98f07899" type="punctum" xml:id="m-822b78e8-fc5c-404a-a9b6-aec341eadf1a">
                  <nc xml:id="m-c7fb82eb-c5a8-4ba6-b857-ec79faf00e47" pname="e" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-328705bb-e5eb-4023-b370-3135d350cb71">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-fd50ed8b-fdc6-4b3a-9560-8a6237ba4d4c" type="clivis" xml:id="m-4353ed17-4950-4b2d-83c8-01525b454053">
                  <nc xml:id="m-556b4d51-56f5-48d8-9fd0-fee346c5ed90" pname="e" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-9a063111-9eca-462f-880a-f367bf91f4b8" pname="d" oct="3">
                    <signifLet xml:id="m-6ec12e56-9fb0-4256-88d4-3cdea8912ddb" /></nc></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-69790461-195e-4199-8aa1-8216ff690846" facs="#m-dcdbaa93-f554-4e11-83a2-851d9af2fcd3" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-680b7699-aa6a-4888-93b2-50b3cdf323dc"><lg xml:id="m-60364ae5-4eda-4896-99df-6e020fdef914"><l xml:id="m-3be0422f-34c6-46db-aeb0-5532a95ad3b5" facs="#m-8c98f5af-5498-4847-a466-c1bc5ec4c8f8" label="ambiguous">Iuly 18.</l><l xml:id="m-9b8b575c-f6dd-458c-a2ba-78cf10aab65e" facs="#m-7c84c954-fdfd-4607-9125-946b828096ba" label="ambiguous">1560</l><l xml:id="m-ef4cbb6f-7e98-4c88-8fa9-0d6f302c64d8" facs="#m-21975a84-e197-43da-a498-e0d2575a7c65" label="text-like">Commemoration of St. Symphorosa and Her Seven Sons. Martyrs.</l><l xml:id="m-4adf2992-0e0b-4b8e-8183-85d58966b27a" facs="#m-c842a5e7-7ed1-48bd-9449-a9d86b197a83" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-c3337ae4-3ba2-4828-bfea-381941bb18e3" facs="#m-c7eb7944-8e53-428d-9315-955d4b9ece3e" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui nos concédis sanctórum ]lere:* da nobis in aetérna beati¬</l><l xml:id="m-ed0dc79b-f50e-40db-b858-7d2228726758" facs="#m-57cd5402-791a-4586-9ece-88fb6dba34b8" label="lyrics-like">1 Mártyrum tuórum Symphoró-túdine de eórum societá̂te gaudére.</l><l xml:id="m-b1b12e6d-853a-4d40-be33-5a5befd78faa" facs="#m-d1d301a3-5063-4def-8d1e-d5d915c385de" label="lyrics-like">sae et fisiórum ejus natalitia có-Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-f46bcbe2-fbd6-4d68-ab58-397092b3cc2b" facs="#m-e53b5064-6fab-47f9-97a2-335f6c91f3b6" label="lyrics-like">Epistie. Nolite mirári. p. 961.</l><l xml:id="m-0089cfcb-3629-4939-bea5-8c51f564d71d" facs="#m-78d11b58-1f08-4963-bd99-9e245fd30f7e" label="lyrics-like">Gradual. Os jústi. D. 1191. Allelúia, allelúia. V. Beátus vir qui timet.</l><l xml:id="m-3ac29144-d498-440c-9d2d-5454017b3ae2" facs="#m-b510ee9c-31eb-46a3-b27e-35b77139c3d4" label="ambiguous"> 1205.</l><l xml:id="m-2eb9a40f-6796-400d-b7aa-298267c9e127" facs="#m-d5854a52-623e-4f6e-b7e1-00e8746fe6aa" label="ambiguous">* Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Joannem. Joann. 15. b.</l><l xml:id="m-cd388515-edbf-4840-9dde-009b5b76331a" facs="#m-8aab4eda-7221-4f14-bdf6-9419bb1724ef" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Dixit Jesus di- quid fáciat dóminus ejus. Vos au¬</l><l xml:id="m-0919bbc6-24ef-4f66-98ba-201df247357f" facs="#m-a3f687f1-56ee-4c94-9fd6-8451bfa4de94" label="lyrics-like">Lscípulis suis: Hoc est praecé¬</l><l xml:id="m-f16daca5-1313-4b7d-8c70-7d957c2d4731" facs="#m-6d831057-9c91-4b5c-8099-fc9ed3bc40e6" label="lyrics-like">tem dixi amicos: quia ómnia</l><l xml:id="m-51d3c125-90d4-4304-acba-6005e38d7498" facs="#m-7a1fddb1-ad36-45f3-9915-e18c7de4d311" label="lyrics-like">ptum meum, ut diligátis invicem,</l><l xml:id="m-5ed5f585-0e16-4e55-89aa-7d07c2a109c5" facs="#m-edafba6e-7a15-403b-98ea-b1b32128f450" label="lyrics-like">quaecúmque audívi a Patre meo,</l><l xml:id="m-a0e42fbc-01b8-4ba0-81b5-1f5f8f9bbf70" facs="#m-0cbebc29-298c-4bc3-9e4c-4e11a58d2397" label="ambiguous">nota feci vobis. Non vos me elegi¬</l><l xml:id="m-f84f157e-5783-4fcc-b969-418f26c58dc1" facs="#m-1f54c40a-f892-46c9-90c8-6579f3ac219e" label="lyrics-like">sicut diléxi vos. Maiorem hac dile¬</l><l xml:id="m-7f907b86-b0ce-417b-8b03-9df9a513ca57" facs="#m-2a5b533d-d7f2-423f-8a8a-3776092136dc" label="lyrics-like">ctiónem nemo habet, ut ánimam</l><l xml:id="m-d0bf0d44-bf64-4078-8ce1-75f047e3617e" facs="#m-8f9a8bf9-3b82-412d-a7bb-eaf936c60948" label="lyrics-like">stis: sed ego elégi vos, et pósui</l><l xml:id="m-149e9398-1630-4755-8698-62720b419360" facs="#m-37847d7d-d8a6-4b06-b6a2-4e9d2eec4c11" label="lyrics-like">vos, ut eátis et fructum afferâtis:</l><l xml:id="m-79fcda09-021b-4f19-bb2b-3037fdf3e53e" facs="#m-eb2f7d03-99ed-41a7-b554-aecdc535857c" label="lyrics-like">suam ponat quis pro amícis suis.</l><l xml:id="m-f619a059-3c2c-4e97-88ec-2e854f925bbf" facs="#m-4064bb01-ec58-40bb-ad28-e190b05901fc" label="lyrics-like">Vos amíci mei estis, si fecéritis</l><l xml:id="m-f6af0125-d7e3-46d9-b7c0-28b14f5583c1" facs="#m-39107d2d-e33c-419b-8ab7-f9efee235205" label="lyrics-like">et fructus vester máneat : ut quod¬</l><l xml:id="m-1e475fa6-cd7a-4859-88a6-5e8d29cc812b" facs="#m-f486bd9f-3a3a-44df-9d25-bbe6b684b31d" label="lyrics-like">quae ego praecípio vobis. Jam non! cúmque petiéritis Patrem in nómine</l><l xml:id="m-afd4fc0c-8c35-4c5d-925c-22e10c9c7eb8" facs="#m-e3831b0e-0622-4270-b852-884e71717369" label="ambiguous">dicam vos servos, quia servus nescit ] meo, det vobis.</l><l xml:id="m-527e2d85-bee4-4f40-bc00-d2605ba80872" facs="#m-0e24a4c5-ffa3-47c3-b3eb-b6e570935abe" label="lyrics-like">Offertory. In virtúte túa. p. 1205.</l><l xml:id="m-0f226d60-f763-4010-ae47-87d8959f9ca8" facs="#m-3cd1d6a4-feba-42ed-b2fd-7673757067f2" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-155eda53-d9d8-4ef0-9370-e805fd34eb13" facs="#m-ed6d3d59-bcd1-43ec-bcf9-4f48514c92c0" label="lyrics-like">zOstia immaculáta, qua illud Dó¬ córporis et ánimae infirmitátes sa¬</l><l xml:id="m-087d3ad5-6afe-484b-a3a1-d6db885b168e" facs="#m-cd354410-4247-4dcc-9167-1a565720a7c1" label="text-like">At mini nostri Jesu Christi im¬</l><l xml:id="m-c52de717-29ba-4321-b62f-a06184d83812" facs="#m-14f59206-d9b3-470f-93c2-c36ae976a766" label="lyrics-like">lutáre remédium, et in extrémo</l><l xml:id="m-f534068f-c80b-42cc-9261-0ca02bd43124" facs="#m-a50a6b51-ac68-4a01-9473-c462f3179dd8" label="lyrics-like">agóne solátium et tutéla. Per eúm¬</l><l xml:id="m-14889ce5-9927-4d2c-972e-f4f902a83f29" facs="#m-5359e8d1-5243-4c33-9ee9-0a79e63bad71" label="lyrics-like">ménsae caritátis opus renovámus,</l><l xml:id="m-99bc4fbb-2df8-45b8-b285-dfd0f8350752" facs="#m-26ab1130-8566-4669-a23e-12b607f9ee98" label="lyrics-like">sit, Deus Pater omnípotens, sancto</l><l xml:id="m-844e264c-a9bf-4b30-b3f1-5c3af400f4b4" facs="#m-e75db925-19da-442e-94cf-37ee58403af0" label="lyrics-like">dem Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-8ba1b7ec-a444-44bd-815c-4eee1bc9206a" facs="#m-a13957c9-ba1e-4292-b6e9-6a0cfdfc5bf9" label="lyrics-like">Camillo intercedénte, contra omnes</l><l xml:id="m-f8ffd1db-41be-46a9-ad3f-5f209dcd0eea" facs="#m-689308f7-b601-4954-a29f-b28b6df4a248" label="text-like">of the Holy Martyrs. Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-51fd0b07-07b8-4f44-9609-08cd96d000e5" facs="#m-d95f39e2-c6f3-470e-b535-d88bd52c37d2" label="lyrics-like">Unera tibi Dómine nostrae! justórum, et nobis salutária, te</l><l xml:id="m-09377ee7-d31c-4354-9724-b63668fb065a" facs="#m-aece1e80-110f-4afd-8d99-cd03747a8978" label="lyrics-like">1 devotiónis offérimus: quae et! miseránte, reddántur. Per Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-d18ea71b-4cb2-4a4a-82ef-aa8781791f54" facs="#m-b5b1511d-6958-4d1d-a625-74d8cc671544" label="lyrics-like">pro tuórum tibi grata sint honóre! num.</l><l xml:id="m-d9f7cd8a-7d3a-434c-889d-92460aabf0fd" facs="#m-29f00ed4-8a67-460a-bac5-da5b7558d0f9" label="ambiguous">comm.E</l><l xml:id="m-c2817b58-e982-48ca-9908-a4687054be1f" facs="#m-c3f302bd-25ab-45e1-a275-7b6ce0fcff80" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-09067197-0aef-4f58-8065-348bc18173c2" facs="#m-35e9d689-e263-4d16-a3a4-9faa0d733186" label="lyrics-like">INfírmus fú¬</l><l xml:id="m-5aaf834b-cff0-40a3-9e70-5f846ab9ccf9" facs="#m-c407c1fe-8275-4977-bd58-7ee431ec0716" label="lyrics-like">et vi-si-tástis me.</l><l xml:id="m-c3e9e70d-9100-4527-8b24-17def2803e39" facs="#m-90d7b40f-85d9-49cc-8753-65be1f12fdd9" label="ambiguous">i</l><l xml:id="m-0738bef6-3d73-4c2a-b466-06c07e44d0ee" facs="#m-48ad4c61-59ec-48ad-9d5c-a60840f17463" label="ambiguous">Amen,</l><l xml:id="m-64846ff3-aee3-40cb-b19f-2ff6ffa0f0df" facs="#m-d51d9d73-eff7-460b-9a7b-b3f3b876ea64" label="lyrics-like">ú-ni ex his</l><l xml:id="m-7bc46c7b-09aa-44c8-ba3c-f8b11dbcf275" facs="#m-2fe9a47a-6cab-499f-9b34-72506e96a37e" label="lyrics-like">amen dí-co vó¬ bis: Quámdi-u fe-cí-stis</l><l xml:id="m-cecfcfa0-84c0-4158-8c8e-3aa77ae08bae" facs="#m-2b07fe0c-c923-488e-acbe-0126cd39b855" label="lyrics-like">frátribus mé-is mínimis, mí-hi fe-cí- stis.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>